    "registration": {
      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "FU I-chien 傅以漸 (T. 于磬, H. 星巖), 1609–1665, was a native of Liao'ch'êng, Shantung. He took his chin-shih with highest honors in 1646, and so was the first scholar to receive the degree of chuang-yüan 狀元 or optimus in the Ch'ing dynasty.",
          "source": "eccp-3639191",
          "kind": "source-wording",
          "status": "imported"
        },
        {
          "text": "傅以漸，字於磐，山東聊城人。",
          "source": "qsg-volume-238",
